{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"亚里士多德·controversies-and-appraisal","stage":"DONE","category":"aristotle","categoryLabel":"亚里士多德","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/23_aristotle/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"亚里士多德-争议与评价\">亚里士多德·争议与评价</h1><p>本 hub 是亚里士多德系列的<strong>收束篇</strong>：前五个兄弟 hub 分别讲述他的生平、贡献、思想、著作与影响，本 hub 则退后一步，<strong>全面而辩证地评判</strong>这位思想巨人——既正视他的科学错误与社会观念局限，也理解他权威被神化所带来的&quot;负担&quot;，并最终衡量他作为人类&quot;第一导师&quot;的崇高地位。一句话概括分工：<strong>别处讲他做了什么，这里讲该如何评价他做的一切</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他是谁、经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供评判的传记背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他贡献了什么</td>\n<td>本 hub&quot;功&quot;栏的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他怎么想、怎么做研究</td>\n<td>本 hub评判其方法的依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a></td>\n<td>他写了什么</td>\n<td>各项争议的文本出处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他影响了谁、多久</td>\n<td>本 hub&quot;权威负担&quot;与&quot;千年影响&quot;的史实来源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>争议与评价（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td><strong>该如何评判他</strong></td>\n<td><strong>整合以上，给出辩证结论</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"章节与推荐学习路径\">章节与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1.错误与权威] --&gt; B[2.争论]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3.整体评价]&#10;    A1[科学错误] --&gt; A2[权威的负担]&#10;    B1[奴隶制与妇女] --&gt; B2[柏拉图之争]&#10;    C1[第一导师] --&gt; C2[全面的评判]&#10;    A -.-&gt; A1&#10;    B -.-&gt; B1&#10;    C -.-&gt; C1\">flowchart LR\n    A[1.错误与权威] --&gt; B[2.争论]\n    B --&gt; C[3.整体评价]\n    A1[科学错误] --&gt; A2[权威的负担]\n    B1[奴隶制与妇女] --&gt; B2[柏拉图之争]\n    C1[第一导师] --&gt; C2[全面的评判]\n    A -.-&gt; A1\n    B -.-&gt; B1\n    C -.-&gt; C1</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>错误与权威</strong>——<a href=\"errors-and-authority/scientific-errors\">科学上的错误</a>（落体、地心说被证伪及其方法论根源）→ <a href=\"errors-and-authority/the-burden-of-authority\">权威的负担</a>（错误为何能统治千年）。</li>\n<li><strong>争论</strong>——<a href=\"debates/slavery-and-women\">奴隶制与妇女</a>（社会观念的污点与论证拆解）→ <a href=\"debates/plato-versus-aristotle\">柏拉图与亚里士多德之争</a>（贯穿哲学史的两极）。</li>\n<li><strong>整体评价</strong>——<a href=\"overall-appraisal/the-first-teacher\">第一导师</a>（称号的配得性）→ <a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a>（功过对账与辩证收束）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>建议按 1→2→3 顺序阅读：先看清局限，再理解争论，最后才能做出不偏不倚的整体评判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>了解亚里士多德的基本贡献（逻辑、生物学、伦理、政治），见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。</li>\n<li>了解他的经验方法，有助于理解其科学错误的根源，见 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/empirical-method/\">经验方法</a>。</li>\n<li>阅读&quot;柏拉图之争&quot;前，建议先了解 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/metaphysics/\">形而上学</a>（形式内在于个体的主张）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"贯穿本-hub-的方法论\">贯穿本 hub 的方法论</h2><p>全篇坚持同一条辩证原则：<strong>功不洗过，过不抹功</strong>。地心说错了不损逻辑学之功，逻辑学伟大也不豁免地心说之误。最终目的不是给出一个分数，而是用亚里士多德本人的批判精神去评判亚里士多德——这正是 <a href=\"overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment\">全面的评判</a> 的核心结论。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"errors-and-authority","title":"Errors And Authority","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-errors","title":"科学上的错误","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority/scientific-errors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-burden-of-authority","title":"权威的负担","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/errors-and-authority/the-burden-of-authority"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"Debates","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"slavery-and-women","title":"奴隶制与妇女","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/slavery-and-women"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plato-versus-aristotle","title":"柏拉图与亚里士多德之争","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/plato-versus-aristotle"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"Overall Appraisal","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-first-teacher","title":"第一导师","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-first-teacher"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"全面的评判","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}